              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"query {\\n  users(pageSize: 100) {\\n    nodes {\\n      id email firstName lastName role isActive createdAt updatedAt lastLoginAt\\n      tenant { id name slug plan isActive createdAt updatedAt }\\n    }\\n    pageInfo { page pageSize totalCount totalPages hasNext }\\n  }\\n}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Cheap to send, expensive to serve. Rejected before execution with QUERY_REJECTED. Check the X-GraphQL-Complexity response header."
