      "description": "Cross-tenant control plane, authenticated with X-Platform-Token rather than any customer credential. No tenant JWT, however privileged inside its own tenant, can reach these operations. An absent or wrong token returns 404, so the control plane does not advertise itself. Get the token from `terraform output -raw platform_admin_token`, or from PLATFORM_ADMIN_TOKEN locally."
